	)
	(text "No 120 Ω termination on this board, which is deliberate. This is a passive listen-only tap\non an already-terminated vehicle FMS bus. Adding termination would load the bus and degrade \nit for the OEM tracker sharing the same port."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 131.318 123.952 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6c8bcb6e-0e95-4c00-b625-f7822cc327bb")
	)
	(text "Firmware GPIO assignments:\n- GPIO16 = Ignition sense input (digital or ADC)\n- GPIO17 = CAN UART TX (drives TJA1051 pin 1 TXD)\n- GPIO18 = CAN UART RX (reads TJA1051 pin 4 RXD)\n- CAN bit rate: 250 kbps (verify against FMS-standard for your trucks)\n- TJA1051 is in listen-only mode (S pin = VIO)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 131.318 151.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "70c92856-f6bb-4101-a567-914bbbf7cdd0")
	)
	(text "Voltage regulator 24V-5V"
